WEBVTT

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:20.720
TERRIFYING! A DISASTROUS TRANSFER STUDENT
APPEARS! (PART ONE)

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:22.350
<i>Morning.</i>

00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:25.310
<i>I stayed up late to play video games</i>
<i>last night.</i>

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:26.360
<i>Morning, Yumi.</i>

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:27.310
<i>-Huh?</i>
-Morning.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:30.940
<i>I thought there must be a transfer student</i>
<i>as usual, but not this time?</i>

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:34.150
<i>Great. It's like a custom though,</i>
<i>they should be running out of ideas.</i>

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:36.070
<i>That is a right decision...</i>

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:38.200
-Saiki, bad news!
<i>-What is it, transfer student number one?</i>

00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:40.540
We've got
an unbelievable transfer student!

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:41.450
<i>There it is.</i>

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:42.910
CLASS 2-2

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.080
That's her, Hii Suzumiya.

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:46.960
She just transferred
into our class yesterday.

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:48.670
<i>What? She seems like a normal girl.</i>

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:50.750
So, even you can't see it.

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:52.840
Even I can't deal with her.

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:54.300
She has an "ability"!

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:56.300
<i>Is there a girl you can't deal with?</i>

00:00:56.390 --> 00:00:58.260
You're supposed to be surprised
about her ability.

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:01.520
Oh, Toritsuka...

00:01:02.060 --> 00:01:06.190
I need to go to the chemistry lab.
Can you show me how I get there again?

00:01:06.270 --> 00:01:08.730
Oh... the lab? Sure!

00:01:08.810 --> 00:01:11.610
Just go straight to the end
of this hallway and there's the stairs...

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:12.570
Oh, that way!

00:01:12.650 --> 00:01:13.690
Whoa!

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:14.990
TUMBLE

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:17.410
-Ouch...
-Are you alright?

00:01:17.490 --> 00:01:19.660
Sorry, I stepped on a banana peel.

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:20.910
I know...

00:01:20.990 --> 00:01:24.080
Oh gosh! I'm sorry!
Let me clean your face with my towel.

00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:27.210
-No, it's gone! I've dropped it somewhere.
-Ah, it's okay. Don't worry.

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:29.500
Oh, there's a mysterious bug on the peel.

00:01:29.590 --> 00:01:30.420
<i>Is this for real?</i>

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:31.550
<i>Thirty minutes earlier.</i>

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:34.630
<i>-She has an ability?</i>
-I can say so

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:37.590
because she is unbelievably unlucky.

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:39.800
<i>She is so unlucky that</i>
<i>it can be considered as her ability?</i>

00:01:39.890 --> 00:01:43.270
<i>-Wasn't it just her unlucky day?</i>
-I'm talking on a totally different level!

00:01:43.350 --> 00:01:45.480
Something was wrong from the beginning.

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:47.230
-It was yesterday during the homeroom.
<i>-Hold on.</i>

00:01:47.310 --> 00:01:49.480
-What is it?
<i>-Are you trying to start a flashback?</i>

00:01:49.560 --> 00:01:50.440
Yeah, why?

00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:52.770
<i>Don't. I'm already having</i>
<i>a flashback, too.</i>

00:01:52.860 --> 00:01:55.400
-What? What're you talking about?
<i>-Stop making it confusing.</i>

00:01:55.490 --> 00:01:56.570
<i>The previous day.</i>

00:01:56.650 --> 00:01:59.780
<i>-Anyway, it was during the homeroom!</i>
<i>-Hey, you didn't stop.</i>

00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:03.120
<i>We were so excited</i>
<i>about the news of a transfer student.</i>

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:04.040
Come on in.

00:02:04.450 --> 00:02:07.120
<i>I couldn't care less, so I was just</i>
<i>watching the class with cool disinterest.</i>

00:02:07.210 --> 00:02:08.040
<i>Does he mean "excited"?</i>

00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:10.500
<i>Then, there she was.</i>

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:13.960
<i>Everybody became silent</i>
<i>as soon as they saw her.</i>

00:02:14.630 --> 00:02:16.420
<i>Her body was already covered by wounds.</i>

00:02:16.510 --> 00:02:17.550
What happened to you?

00:02:17.630 --> 00:02:19.470
I was hit by a hearse.

00:02:19.550 --> 00:02:21.600
<i>Those were the first words she said</i>
<i>on her first day.</i>

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:22.510
<i>She introduced her accident, not herself.</i>

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:26.980
<i>Our teacher told her to go to a hospital,</i>
<i>but she insisted she was fine.</i>

00:02:27.060 --> 00:02:30.150
<i>Then she was gonna introduce herself, but</i>
<i>there was not even a piece of chalk left.</i>

00:02:30.230 --> 00:02:31.270
<i>How unlucky.</i>

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:36.110
<i>But luckily, she could use her own blood</i>
<i>from her shoulder to write her name.</i>

00:02:36.190 --> 00:02:37.650
<i>Nothing about that is lucky.</i>

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:39.950
<i>Thirty minutes earlier again.</i>

00:02:40.030 --> 00:02:41.990
<i>Getting hit by a car</i>
<i>on her first day is unlucky,</i>

00:02:42.070 --> 00:02:43.030
<i>but you can't say</i>
<i>that it's more than that.</i>

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:45.200
No, it was just a start.

00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:46.790
<i>Flashback to yesterday again.</i>

00:02:46.950 --> 00:02:49.330
-I'm Hii Suzumiya...
<i>-Loud punk bikers passed by as she talked.</i>

00:02:49.410 --> 00:02:50.420
<i>The punks were up early.</i>

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:54.130
<i>-And she's got the very front seat.</i>
<i>-Why was that seat even available?</i>

00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:56.340
<i>And she stepped on poop</i>
<i>before taking a seat. Awful!</i>

00:02:56.420 --> 00:02:57.380
Gross!

00:02:57.460 --> 00:02:59.930
<i>Will you explain why there was poop</i>
<i>in the classroom?</i>

00:03:00.510 --> 00:03:02.260
<i>And 30 minutes earlier again.</i>

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:05.430
Would you still say she's merely unlucky
after seeing the series of disasters?

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:07.810
<i>Yesterday.</i>

00:03:07.890 --> 00:03:10.100
<i>But there was a guy</i>
<i>who offered her help.</i>

00:03:10.190 --> 00:03:11.310
Are you alright? Use this.

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:14.770
<i>-It was me sitting next to her.</i>
<i>-Oh, I really feel sorry for her...</i>

00:03:15.190 --> 00:03:16.270
<i>About 30 minutes earlier.</i>

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:17.940
What made you feel sorry for her?

00:03:18.030 --> 00:03:19.990
<i>Sitting next to you is</i>
<i>the picture of misfortune.</i>

00:03:20.070 --> 00:03:21.360
Do you count it as her misfortune?

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:22.360
<i>Yesterday.</i>

00:03:22.450 --> 00:03:24.370
<i>So, I was talking to her...</i>

00:03:24.450 --> 00:03:26.080
Looks like you've already got
a new friend.

00:03:26.160 --> 00:03:29.160
Then, will you show her
around the school, Toritsuka?

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:31.370
<i>So, I ended up showing her around.</i>

00:03:31.460 --> 00:03:32.580
<i>That's the worst misfortune of the day.</i>

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:33.830
<i>About 30 minutes earlier.</i>

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:36.170
Yes, it was the beginning
of my misfortune.

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:37.550
<i>Not yours, but hers.</i>

00:03:38.090 --> 00:03:40.300
I realized as soon as
I started being with her

00:03:40.470 --> 00:03:43.010
that her bad luck involves
other people around her.

00:03:43.090 --> 00:03:45.220
We were hit by a motorcycle,
then a meteorite,

00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:48.350
and a heavy rainstorm,
and I finally stepped on poop!

00:03:48.430 --> 00:03:49.730
<i>Did they happen in that order?</i>

00:03:49.810 --> 00:03:53.350
My life is in danger!
Please help us, Saiki!

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:54.350
<i>Present, finally.</i>

00:03:54.440 --> 00:03:56.520
<i>I don't care if his life is</i>
<i>in danger or not though...</i>

00:03:56.610 --> 00:03:57.440
I'm so sorry!

00:03:57.520 --> 00:03:59.400
<i>...I'm curious</i>
<i>about her ability-like bad luck.</i>

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:01.360
<i>Does such a person really exist?</i>

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:04.240
Now you know how to get to the lab.
I'll get going then...

00:04:04.780 --> 00:04:09.330
I have no sense of direction,
so do you mind taking me to the lab?

00:04:09.410 --> 00:04:11.370
<i>No! I can't say no to a girl!</i>

00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:12.540
Of course.

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:16.540
<i>But it should be alright.</i>
<i>Saiki is there to help me.</i>

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:18.000
Here is your favorite coffee jelly!

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:20.880
-Saiki!
-Shall we go?

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:25.890
TERRIFYING! A DISASTROUS TRANSFER STUDENT
APPEARS! (PART TWO)

00:04:26.510 --> 00:04:29.100
<i>This is bad. I need to come up with</i>
<i>an excuse to get out of here.</i>

00:04:29.890 --> 00:04:33.600
I'm sorry, Toritsuka.
You don't want to be around me.

00:04:33.690 --> 00:04:35.810
What? That's not what I'm thinking!

00:04:35.900 --> 00:04:37.810
It's okay! I already know.

00:04:37.900 --> 00:04:40.110
I will just cause you trouble.

00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:41.530
<i>So, she is aware of it.</i>

00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:44.860
I've always been like this,
so I can't make friends.

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:45.860
You must be already aware...

00:04:45.950 --> 00:04:47.570
<i>Of course, I'm aware...</i>

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:49.160
<i>- ...that you're unlucky.</i>
- ...that I'm so clumsy.

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:50.660
I'm sorry to have bothered you.

00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:54.120
-Clumsy?
-Yes, like I stepped on the banana peel.

00:04:54.210 --> 00:04:55.870
You stepped on poop
because you are clumsy?

00:04:55.960 --> 00:04:58.210
Yes, I should have watched my steps.
So embarrassing.

00:04:58.290 --> 00:04:59.500
And that rainstorm, too?

00:04:59.590 --> 00:05:02.840
Yes, I forgot to check the forecast
and didn't carry an umbrella.

00:05:02.920 --> 00:05:03.880
And the meteorite?

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:06.590
Yes, I should have passed there
30 seconds earlier.

00:05:06.680 --> 00:05:09.970
<i>That's not what it is! But I can't say so</i>
<i>as it would just make her hopeless.</i>

00:05:10.060 --> 00:05:13.060
I've always been so clumsy. Such a klutz.

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:14.020
CHEMISTRY LAB

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:16.100
Oh, here it is. Thank you.

00:05:16.190 --> 00:05:18.400
No problem.
But what did you come here for?

00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:20.820
The chemistry teacher asked me to bring
some chemicals.

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:21.940
So unlucky...

00:05:22.030 --> 00:05:24.820
I have to bring sulfuric acid,
potassium cyanide and nitroglycerin.

00:05:24.900 --> 00:05:26.070
<i>Sounds like it'll be a disaster!</i>

00:05:26.150 --> 00:05:27.910
Wait! Let me do that for you!

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:30.280
-But...
-Go back to the classroom, will you?

00:05:30.370 --> 00:05:32.990
But I was the one the teacher asked.
Oh, why don't we go together?

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:34.750
No! That's the worst case scenario!

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:37.830
-Let's go in there.
-Wait! Please let me do this alone!

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:39.920
I can't let you do everything for me.

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:42.050
Sorry, I remember something.
I've gotta go now!

00:05:42.130 --> 00:05:43.380
-Saiki?
-I'm here, too.

00:05:43.460 --> 00:05:46.130
-Why are you here?
<i>-What do you mean? I'm here to help you.</i>

00:05:46.220 --> 00:05:47.220
Saiki...

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:49.140
<i>I was late because</i>
<i>I was eating a coffee jelly.</i>

00:05:49.220 --> 00:05:51.970
-Saiki!
<i>-Seems like you were in real danger.</i>

00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:55.770
<i>Aiura noticed that the shadow of death was</i>
<i>clearly visible on both of you guys.</i>

00:05:55.850 --> 00:05:58.190
Damn! So scary! You guys already look
like dead men!

00:05:58.270 --> 00:05:59.940
<i>Like it's been painted on your faces.</i>

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:01.610
<i>You could have died here.</i>

00:06:01.690 --> 00:06:03.190
That's not funny...

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:04.900
<i>We've already brought the chemicals in,</i>
<i>so leave now.</i>

00:06:04.990 --> 00:06:06.610
Yes! Hii, let's go!

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:09.240
<i>Good grief, even Toritsuka,</i>
<i>I'd feel bad if I let him die.</i>

00:06:09.320 --> 00:06:11.580
This is bad... Worse than it was.

00:06:11.660 --> 00:06:13.490
We've all got death marks!

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:14.660
<i>All of us?</i>

00:06:14.740 --> 00:06:15.580
DEATH

00:06:15.660 --> 00:06:18.870
<i>-No way. It's not possible for me.</i>
-But it's terribly obvious.

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:20.500
Then, mine hasn't disappeared?

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:22.710
It's gotten darker
that I can't even see your face now.

00:06:22.790 --> 00:06:25.420
-I have one on my face, too. You, come!
-Yes?

00:06:25.510 --> 00:06:28.470
It's hard to see it in the reflection
on the window, so let me take a selfie.

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:30.590
See? We all have death marks on our faces.

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:31.850
<i>Why did you upload the photo</i>
<i>on social media?</i>

00:06:31.930 --> 00:06:33.930
Wow, can you send me the pic?

00:06:34.010 --> 00:06:35.180
Kusuo, turn off your aura.

00:06:35.270 --> 00:06:37.480
Oh shit. This is out of control.

00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:39.900
I've never seen such a sinister aura.

00:06:39.980 --> 00:06:41.860
I'm sending the pic to mom
saying I've made some friends.

00:06:41.940 --> 00:06:45.070
This is real bad.
We're in a real bind as psychickers.

00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:47.440
Hey, where the hell are you going?

00:06:47.610 --> 00:06:51.360
I'm running away, of course!
I have to get away from her!

00:06:51.450 --> 00:06:54.200
Being away from her may not save you.
You'll abandon her?

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:57.700
Who cares? I can't stay here any longer!
I'm going home now!

00:06:57.790 --> 00:06:59.330
<i>A next victim usually says so in a movie.</i>

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:00.540
She can kill even Saiki.

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:02.500
I am no match for her!

00:07:02.580 --> 00:07:04.090
<i>That's something I can't accept.</i>

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:07.510
<i>I shouldn't brag about it</i>
<i>but I can't imagine myself dying.</i>

00:07:07.590 --> 00:07:10.590
<i>Even if a missile hits here right now,</i>
<i>I should be able to survive.</i>

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:11.590
Then, Kusuo...

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:14.050
maybe you'll die protecting me?

00:07:14.140 --> 00:07:17.850
<i>-I don't think that's the case.</i>
-If that happened, I'd die with you!

00:07:17.930 --> 00:07:18.770
<i>Not think, I know so.</i>

00:07:18.850 --> 00:07:21.440
Death marks don't necessary mean death.

00:07:21.520 --> 00:07:24.860
We'd just have bad luck
which could kill a normal person.

00:07:24.940 --> 00:07:27.070
<i>Then she should have a death mark</i>
<i>every day.</i>

00:07:27.150 --> 00:07:28.820
What are you guys talking about?

00:07:28.900 --> 00:07:30.650
-Nothing!
-Yeah, nothing special.

00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:32.070
-Hii?
-Yes?

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:33.070
What are those?

00:07:33.160 --> 00:07:37.120
These are nitroglycerin. I found a lot,
so I decided to take as much as I can.

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:40.330
<i>Nitroglycerin is an organic compound that</i>
<i>can explode even with a slight shock.</i>

00:07:40.410 --> 00:07:42.790
<i>The undiluted solution is rarely seen.</i>

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:43.750
We are in danger!

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:46.290
-Hold on! Don't move! Stop!
-What? What's going on?

00:07:46.380 --> 00:07:48.960
That's really dangerous!
It explodes with a slight shock!

00:07:49.460 --> 00:07:51.760
What? Is this so dangerous?

00:07:51.840 --> 00:07:53.390
-Hey!
-Please be gentle!

00:07:53.470 --> 00:07:56.010
-Put them slowly on the table one by one!
-Be careful!

00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:57.760
Please don't leave me alone!

00:07:57.850 --> 00:07:59.720
Yes, like that! Slowly!

00:07:59.810 --> 00:08:02.810
Yes! You made it! We'd have been killed
if you had dropped a bottle!

00:08:02.890 --> 00:08:04.600
-We're safe now!
-I'm so relieved!

00:08:04.690 --> 00:08:07.770
I had no idea that they are
such dangerous chemicals...

00:08:07.860 --> 00:08:10.320
A... a... a... Achoo!

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:12.320
I didn't expect such a big sneeze
from you!

00:08:13.320 --> 00:08:15.200
NITROGLYCERIN

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:17.200
Oh, excuse me.

00:08:17.280 --> 00:08:19.410
Where are those chemicals?

00:08:19.490 --> 00:08:20.910
<i>You blew them away.</i>

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:22.710
-Saiki!
-Kusuo!

00:08:22.790 --> 00:08:25.960
<i>Good grief. I've been involved with</i>
<i>someone crazy.</i>

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:30.960
TERRIFYING! A DISASTROUS TRANSFER STUDENT
APPEARS! (PART THREE)

00:08:31.590 --> 00:08:33.380
<i>In the previous episodes...</i>

00:08:34.550 --> 00:08:37.760
<i>Summer was over</i>
<i>and a transfer student came in as usual.</i>

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:42.100
<i>Her name is Hii Suzumiya,</i>
<i>transferred into Toritsuka's class.</i>

00:08:42.180 --> 00:08:44.640
<i>She just looked so harmless,</i>

00:08:44.770 --> 00:08:47.650
<i>but normal transfer students</i>
<i>are not needed in this anime.</i>

00:08:48.190 --> 00:08:51.190
<i>She is an unbelievably unlucky person.</i>

00:08:51.320 --> 00:08:55.200
<i>And her misfortune involves</i>
<i>other people around her.</i>

00:08:55.280 --> 00:08:59.120
<i>Toritsuka,</i><i>who approached her with</i>
<i>ulterior motives, was exposed to danger.</i>

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:02.620
<i>Toritsuka went to the lab</i>
<i>to get chemicals with her.</i>

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:06.330
<i>Aiura noticed death marks on them</i>
<i>and went to the lab with Saiki,</i>

00:09:06.420 --> 00:09:10.840
<i>but her misfortunes severely threatened</i>
<i>the psychickers of PK Academy.</i>

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:15.340
Nice to meet you, Saiki and Aiura.

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:18.890
My name is Hii Suzumiya.
I transferred into class 2 yesterday.

00:09:18.970 --> 00:09:21.310
We're in different classes,
but hope we can be friends.

00:09:21.390 --> 00:09:23.220
Yeah, right... It's nice to meet you...

00:09:23.310 --> 00:09:27.060
<i>It's not really nice. Anyways,</i>
<i>are the death marks still on our faces?</i>

00:09:27.150 --> 00:09:29.810
You three are good friends,
though you are not in the same class.

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:31.520
<i>Yup, still clearly shown on our faces.</i>

00:09:31.610 --> 00:09:35.490
Yes, we are very good friends.

00:09:35.570 --> 00:09:38.530
If you have any concerns,
talk to them anytime.

00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:41.330
A friend of your friend is your friend.

00:09:41.410 --> 00:09:45.000
I have a duty to clean
the blackboard erasers, so see you around!

00:09:45.330 --> 00:09:47.080
<i>You can't leave the unluckiest girl to us.</i>

00:09:47.210 --> 00:09:48.330
Yes, I knew that.

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:50.000
Hey, what is it?

00:09:50.090 --> 00:09:54.170
I got into the top 50 on the last test,
so my father bought it for me.

00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:55.510
Seriously? How nice!

00:09:55.590 --> 00:09:57.380
A chain sickle. Isn't this cool?

00:09:57.470 --> 00:09:59.470
I've always wanted one, too.

00:09:59.550 --> 00:10:01.180
Please let me swing it.

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:03.060
No, I don't want you to break it.

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:04.680
Then let me touch the chain
and the weight.

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:05.770
Stop it!

00:10:05.890 --> 00:10:08.850
It'd be great
if you could become my friend,

00:10:08.940 --> 00:10:12.940
but I might cause you trouble
because I'm clumsy and fall down a lot.

00:10:17.450 --> 00:10:20.070
Oh, gosh, I slipped again
just as I said. Sorry...

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:21.370
-Did you see it?
-I did.

00:10:21.450 --> 00:10:23.740
Thank you for your help.

00:10:23.830 --> 00:10:24.830
Oh, a foul ball!

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:29.170
A baseball hit my face!

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:31.040
-I have to carry these to the lab.
-Why is the window open?

00:10:31.710 --> 00:10:33.630
Oh no! The alcohol lamps are
all shattered!

00:10:33.710 --> 00:10:35.800
No! They are all broken!

00:10:35.880 --> 00:10:37.220
Oh, are you alright?

00:10:37.300 --> 00:10:40.430
<i>-Oh, it's Matsuzaki! Hide it now!</i>
<i>-Come on! Throw it away now!</i>

00:10:43.640 --> 00:10:44.600
<i>Enough already!</i>

00:10:47.230 --> 00:10:49.190
<i>Don't clap but do something.</i>

00:10:49.270 --> 00:10:52.610
No way. I feel like we live in the world
of <i>Final Destination.</i>

00:10:52.690 --> 00:10:53.900
I still see the death marks, by the way.

00:10:53.980 --> 00:10:54.940
<i>Good grief...</i>

00:10:55.020 --> 00:10:58.650
Oh, why are you lying down there?
Did you fall?

00:10:58.950 --> 00:11:01.530
Oh, Toritsuka. Were you okay
when the ball hit you?

00:11:01.610 --> 00:11:02.620
Uh, yeah... I'm fine.

00:11:04.870 --> 00:11:07.290
<i>Oh, I see. These people are just like me.</i>

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:10.170
I really feel like
I can get along with you all.

00:11:10.250 --> 00:11:11.370
<i>We're not your clumsy buddies.</i>

00:11:11.460 --> 00:11:14.630
Please let me know
if you forgot to bring something.

00:11:14.710 --> 00:11:17.340
<i>-I'm not clumsy like you.</i>
-You, too...

00:11:17.420 --> 00:11:20.300
Actually, I don't really forget
to bring anything.

00:11:20.380 --> 00:11:22.300
I rather carry too much with me.

00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:26.560
I used to forget a lot and get scolded, so
I've got a habit of carrying things on me.

00:11:26.640 --> 00:11:28.770
Like a TV remote,

00:11:28.850 --> 00:11:31.060
PE uniforms which I don't need today,

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:35.400
the sewing kit I just used in a class,
and toilet paper from the restroom.

00:11:35.480 --> 00:11:36.610
<i>So, you stole them.</i>

00:11:36.690 --> 00:11:38.070
And the chemicals from earlier.

00:11:40.110 --> 00:11:42.280
-What are you carrying with you?
-What are you carrying with you?

00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:46.240
-What was the noise?
-That was really loud.

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:48.580
What happened? What's this smoke?

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:50.710
-Was it an explosion?
-Anyone there?

00:11:50.790 --> 00:11:52.960
-Call an ambulance!
-Ouch...

00:11:53.460 --> 00:11:56.250
Oh? Am I alive?
What? The wall is fixing itself?

00:11:58.420 --> 00:12:01.550
<i>Good grief. We would have been dead</i>
<i>if I was 0.02 seconds later...</i>

00:12:01.630 --> 00:12:03.050
<i>I turned back the time</i>
<i>on the school building.</i>

00:12:03.130 --> 00:12:03.970
SMOKE SCREEN

00:12:04.050 --> 00:12:06.470
<i>The chemicals belong to school,</i>
<i>so they were also restored.</i>

00:12:06.550 --> 00:12:09.430
<i>There was a noise and shock wave,</i>
<i>but it should be okay.</i>

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:12.690
My body floated in the air for a second,
but I'm alright. Oh, where's Hii?

00:12:12.770 --> 00:12:13.980
I'm under your feet...

00:12:14.060 --> 00:12:15.650
-Oh, sorry!
<i>-She really is unlucky.</i>

00:12:15.730 --> 00:12:16.980
Are you alright, Hii?

00:12:17.070 --> 00:12:19.320
I'm fine. Thank you so much.

00:12:19.400 --> 00:12:20.240
For what?

00:12:20.320 --> 00:12:24.990
You saved me from the explosion.
You are wonderful, Milord Toritsuka.

00:12:26.120 --> 00:12:28.870
<i>She has not only bad luck</i>
<i>but also bad taste in men.</i>

00:12:28.950 --> 00:12:30.950
<i>Please give me a break...</i>

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:35.960
READ THE SIGNS!
MIKOTO AIURA'S FORTUNE TELLING

00:12:36.500 --> 00:12:37.920
Hey, your compatibility got better!

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:39.670
-Really?
-Good for you, Chiyo!

00:12:39.750 --> 00:12:42.550
-It was only 2% last time.
-So, what percentage is it now?

00:12:42.630 --> 00:12:45.590
-Let's see. Oh, it's 4% now.
-Wow, it's 4%?

00:12:45.680 --> 00:12:47.640
Four... Only 4%?

00:12:47.720 --> 00:12:49.510
-But it doubled!
-Good for you, Chiyo!

00:12:49.600 --> 00:12:53.480
<i>Oh well, she's doing that again. She is</i>
<i>a psychic with precognition abilities.</i>

00:12:53.560 --> 00:12:54.480
There's a chance!

00:12:54.560 --> 00:12:56.310
-You think so?
<i>-So, her prediction is 100% accurate.</i>

00:12:56.400 --> 00:12:58.270
<i>She'd be in trouble if people find out</i>
<i>she's a real psychic.</i>

00:12:58.360 --> 00:13:01.230
-Was her prediction accurate again?
-Settle down, guys.

00:13:02.240 --> 00:13:03.740
<i>I guess it's too late.</i>

00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:05.740
I should stop fortune telling?

00:13:05.820 --> 00:13:07.320
<i>I'm not telling you to stop it</i>
<i>but do less.</i>

00:13:07.410 --> 00:13:10.240
Huh, why? My fortune telling has become
so viral.

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:12.080
Oh, are you worried about my health?

00:13:12.160 --> 00:13:15.670
<i>No. If you keep up, people will find out</i>
<i>that you're a real psychic.</i>

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:18.790
<i>I don't even want people to realize</i>
<i>that psychics do exist.</i>

00:13:19.710 --> 00:13:23.010
<i>If one psychic is confirmed, people</i>
<i>would think there should be more psychics.</i>

00:13:23.260 --> 00:13:26.260
<i>Then, my true identity would be threatened</i>
<i>to be revealed.</i>

00:13:26.340 --> 00:13:28.140
But that guy is doing whatever he wants.

00:13:28.220 --> 00:13:30.390
<i>He is fine as he has zero reliability.</i>
<i>Anyways--</i>

00:13:30.470 --> 00:13:32.350
No, I'm not gonna stop fortune telling.
As I said before,

00:13:32.430 --> 00:13:37.350
I want to use my abilities to help people
unlike you who only care about yourself.

00:13:37.440 --> 00:13:39.190
Sorry, but I can't.

00:13:39.270 --> 00:13:41.650
Alright, I've got to go
to my fortune-telling job.

00:13:41.730 --> 00:13:42.900
<i>Good grief, I have no choice.</i>

00:13:42.980 --> 00:13:47.110
<i>If you're going to follow your beliefs,</i>
<i>I will follow mine, too.</i>

00:13:47.200 --> 00:13:48.530
FORTUNE TELLERS HOUSE

00:13:48.610 --> 00:13:51.910
Welcome, Mr. Kataya.
Which girl would you like?

00:13:51.990 --> 00:13:53.870
I'd like the most popular girl.

00:13:53.950 --> 00:13:55.330
Sure, that's Mikoto.

00:13:56.620 --> 00:13:58.750
Hi, thanks for choosing me. I'm Mikoto.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:02.500
<i>What kind of place is this?</i>
<i>Is this really for fortune telling?</i>

00:14:02.590 --> 00:14:03.420
INVISIBLE

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:05.630
Okay, go ahead, spit out your problems.

00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:07.720
I'm planning to commit suicide tomorrow.

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:08.840
<i>This is heavy.</i>

00:14:08.930 --> 00:14:10.510
I've lost very important documents.

00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:12.390
It'll be a ten-million-dollar damage
to the company.

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:13.310
<i>Too heavy.</i>

00:14:13.390 --> 00:14:15.060
My life is like shit.

00:14:15.140 --> 00:14:17.190
I don't have any friends
let alone a girlfriend.

00:14:17.270 --> 00:14:19.850
I work 20 hours a day, and as a result,
ten million dollars in debt?

00:14:19.940 --> 00:14:22.520
Even with my lifetime income,
I can't repay that. What was my life?

00:14:22.610 --> 00:14:24.280
<i>He's so stressed out. Now I feel bad</i>

00:14:24.360 --> 00:14:26.150
<i>that I thought this place was pervy.</i>

00:14:26.240 --> 00:14:27.740
<i>-This is a fortune teller house.</i>
-I see.

00:14:27.820 --> 00:14:29.700
<i>The documents are in your house.</i>

00:14:29.780 --> 00:14:31.820
<i>It can't be.</i>
<i>I've searched throughout the house.</i>

00:14:31.910 --> 00:14:35.910
<i>There's a bookshelf with collectable</i>
<i>bottle caps of coke lined up on top of it.</i>

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:37.410
-How do you know that?
<i>-Very nostalgic.</i>

00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:39.620
You'll find them under the bookshelf.

00:14:39.710 --> 00:14:42.380
Right, I didn't search there.
I'll go find that out.

00:14:42.460 --> 00:14:44.460
-Yeah, go check it out.
<i>-She is amazing.</i>

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:47.470
<i>I can't search for something</i>
<i>I've never seen. I kinda envy her.</i>

00:14:47.550 --> 00:14:48.380
Okay, next!

00:14:48.470 --> 00:14:51.010
My puppy has been missing for three days.

00:14:51.090 --> 00:14:54.390
Okay. Do you know a house with
liquor bottles lined up by the window?

00:14:54.470 --> 00:14:55.640
They're taking care of him.

00:14:55.720 --> 00:14:57.270
-Let me ask you straight!
<i>-So weird.</i>

00:14:57.350 --> 00:14:58.680
Will I get married someday?

00:14:58.770 --> 00:15:02.400
Your future wife is in Masvingo,
located in the southeast of Zimbabwe.

00:15:02.480 --> 00:15:05.360
-Mikoto, please have a break.
-Thanks!

00:15:06.190 --> 00:15:07.400
I have many new clients today.

00:15:07.490 --> 00:15:10.570
But I'm in great condition and confident,
so I can do more.

00:15:10.660 --> 00:15:12.450
Oh man! I'll gain more popularity!

00:15:12.530 --> 00:15:15.620
<i>Don't say "Oh man." Good grief,</i>
<i>this is more serious than I thought.</i>

00:15:15.700 --> 00:15:18.080
<i>Her fortune telling is too precise.</i>

00:15:18.660 --> 00:15:21.170
<i>She can't excuse</i>
<i>like "it was just a coincidence."</i>

00:15:21.250 --> 00:15:25.250
<i>These are good enough to prove</i>
<i>that she is a real psychic.</i>

00:15:25.380 --> 00:15:26.500
<i>I have to do something.</i>

00:15:27.090 --> 00:15:31.260
<i>Oh, I had a quarrel with Kusuo again.</i>
<i>But he only cares about himself.</i>

00:15:31.720 --> 00:15:35.720
<i>I admit I might be too stubborn,</i>
<i>but he is too selfish.</i>

00:15:35.810 --> 00:15:37.140
<i>If he said something...</i>

00:15:37.270 --> 00:15:40.440
<i>Aiura... You belong to me.</i>
<i>Use your abilities just for me.</i>

00:15:40.520 --> 00:15:43.190
...like that?
Then, I'd give up fortune telling.

00:15:43.480 --> 00:15:44.900
Oh sorry, I'm having a break--

00:15:44.980 --> 00:15:46.270
Are you Mikoto?

00:15:47.440 --> 00:15:49.070
You're good at searching.

00:15:49.150 --> 00:15:51.530
Our organization needs your abilities.

00:15:51.610 --> 00:15:53.360
-If you resist, I'll kill you.
-What's going on?

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:55.070
Where is the Tokugawa Treasure?

00:15:55.160 --> 00:15:57.870
<i>-How should I know?</i>
<i>-Close your eyes until I say okay.</i>

00:15:57.950 --> 00:15:58.790
<i>Kusuo?</i>

00:15:59.830 --> 00:16:00.910
<i>Okay, open your eyes.</i>

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:03.420
-Kusuo! What the heck...
<i>-I made a ball.</i>

00:16:03.500 --> 00:16:05.960
-Kusuo, I was scared!
<i>-Did it teach you a lesson?</i>

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:06.880
An afterimage?

00:16:06.960 --> 00:16:09.090
<i>How dangerous being exposed</i>
<i>as a psychic is.</i>

00:16:09.170 --> 00:16:11.420
<i>Do you want to risk your life</i>
<i>to help people?</i>

00:16:11.510 --> 00:16:13.550
Sorry, I was too naive.

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:15.340
I'll be more careful from now on.

00:16:15.430 --> 00:16:17.560
<i>It's funny. Kusuo came to help me, too.</i>

00:16:17.640 --> 00:16:19.220
<i>So she didn't learn a lesson.</i>

00:16:19.310 --> 00:16:23.100
Hey, I had many new clients today.
Man, they'll spread the word again.

00:16:23.190 --> 00:16:26.270
<i>No need to worry about it</i>
<i>because I followed my beliefs.</i>

00:16:26.360 --> 00:16:28.230
<i>I made all of your fortune telling</i>
<i>to fail.</i>

00:16:28.320 --> 00:16:31.280
<i>-Except Zimbabwe.</i>
-Thank you, but...

00:16:32.450 --> 00:16:35.110
-I'm still pissed off.
<i>-Better than your life being threatened.</i>

00:16:36.070 --> 00:16:41.000
A DISASTROUS AND OPTIMAL BATTLE!

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:42.460
CLASS 2-2

00:16:42.540 --> 00:16:46.080
-Satou, what's your favorite animal?
-I guess dogs, but I like cats, too.

00:16:46.170 --> 00:16:48.210
<i>Satou is so normal as usual.</i>

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:50.340
-Hey, Kusuo, what're you doing?
<i>-What is it, Miss Abnormal?</i>

00:16:50.670 --> 00:16:53.050
If that's your preference,
I'll do my best to please you.

00:16:53.130 --> 00:16:54.050
<i>That's not what I meant.</i>

00:16:54.130 --> 00:16:58.050
-Are you watching that mob character?
<i>-You don't understand how wonderful he is.</i>

00:16:58.140 --> 00:16:59.810
Is he any different from Takahashi?

00:17:00.010 --> 00:17:01.890
<i>Idiot! Don't lump him in with that jerk.</i>

00:17:01.970 --> 00:17:02.810
Sorry. <i>So close.</i>

00:17:02.890 --> 00:17:05.100
<i>They might be similar but so different.</i>

00:17:05.190 --> 00:17:08.860
<i>Satou is Mr. Standard. He never falls</i>
<i>under the average. He is a majority guy.</i>

00:17:08.940 --> 00:17:10.530
MIDDLE CLASS - ORTHODOX
THE WORLD STANDARD

00:17:10.610 --> 00:17:12.610
<i>On the other hand,</i>
<i>Takahashi is just a mook.</i>

00:17:12.690 --> 00:17:14.860
<i>He never exceeds the average.</i>
<i>He is a boring cliche.</i>

00:17:14.950 --> 00:17:16.110
TYPICAL FAMILY BACKGROUND
THE MASSES - LAYMAN

00:17:16.200 --> 00:17:17.950
<i>Now you know. Don't ever say that again.</i>

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:19.580
You just used different words
for the same thing.

00:17:19.660 --> 00:17:21.990
<i>Look at his seat.</i>
<i>He's right in the middle of the class.</i>

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:25.330
-Wait. It's not in the middle, is it?
<i>-What? It can't be. Did they switch seats?</i>

00:17:25.410 --> 00:17:27.460
Isn't that Hii sitting next to him?

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:28.540
<i>-She's not normal!</i>
-She's not normal!

00:17:28.630 --> 00:17:31.250
<i>Why is the super unlucky girl</i>
<i>sitting next to Satou?</i>

00:17:31.340 --> 00:17:32.760
-Is it that outrageous?
<i>-Of course.</i>

00:17:32.840 --> 00:17:35.010
<i>Not having the middle seat is</i>
<i>already wrong.</i>

00:17:35.090 --> 00:17:40.260
<i>His normalness never misses</i>
<i>the middle seat even if it's a drawing.</i>

00:17:40.350 --> 00:17:41.600
You sure he's not a psychic?

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:43.020
<i>This is gonna be a problem.</i>

00:17:43.100 --> 00:17:45.730
-Hii's bad luck involves others.
-<i>That's right.</i>

00:17:46.480 --> 00:17:49.560
<i>But, since Satou is an average guy,</i>
<i>his luck is also average.</i>

00:17:49.650 --> 00:17:52.320
<i>His life is boring. Nothing really bad</i>
<i>or good has ever happened to him.</i>

00:17:52.400 --> 00:17:53.230
Are you dissing him?

00:17:53.780 --> 00:17:56.570
<i>It's the fight of the century.</i>
<i>Unlucky vs. Normal!</i>

00:17:56.650 --> 00:17:58.360
UNLUCKY - NORMAL

00:17:58.450 --> 00:17:59.820
<i>Oh, I don't care...</i>

00:17:59.910 --> 00:18:01.530
<i>Here it is! A girl carrying a fish tank.</i>

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:05.370
<i>When she drops it,</i>
<i>will Satou be affected by it?</i>

00:18:05.450 --> 00:18:06.460
She can't avoid dropping it?

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:07.870
<i>Here she comes!</i>

00:18:08.370 --> 00:18:09.250
Oh...

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:10.540
<i>Now what?</i>

00:18:10.630 --> 00:18:11.920
LUCK METER

00:18:12.000 --> 00:18:14.130
<i>He's got wet normally!</i>
<i>And he is reacting normally, too!</i>

00:18:14.210 --> 00:18:15.720
Did he lose?

00:18:15.800 --> 00:18:18.630
<i>Even Satou becomes an unlucky guy</i>
<i>when Hii is with him?</i>

00:18:18.720 --> 00:18:21.180
I'm sorry! You got wet because of me!

00:18:21.260 --> 00:18:24.720
Don't worry, it's nothing.
And it wasn't your fault...

00:18:27.270 --> 00:18:28.770
LUCK METER

00:18:28.850 --> 00:18:29.900
Oh, I'm sorry...

00:18:29.980 --> 00:18:31.310
<i>His meter went back to 50%!</i>

00:18:31.400 --> 00:18:34.030
<i>Right, his good luck of seeing her bra</i>
<i>offset his bad luck.</i>

00:18:34.110 --> 00:18:35.820
<i>-And his reaction is normal!</i>
-Hey...

00:18:35.900 --> 00:18:37.900
-Shall we get back to the class...
<i>-This is not the time for that.</i>

00:18:37.990 --> 00:18:39.910
<i>Her bad luck didn't work on him!</i>

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:43.410
<i>I get it! Because Hii Suzumiya transferred</i>
<i>into this class,</i>

00:18:43.490 --> 00:18:45.540
<i>the whole class has been unfortunate.</i>

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:47.500
<i>But it didn't affect Satou, as a result,</i>

00:18:47.580 --> 00:18:49.790
<i>he's become relatively a lucky person.</i>

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:52.000
Oh hell, I don't care about all this
at all.

00:18:52.080 --> 00:18:54.880
<i>But, can't really say</i>
<i>"Normal" defeated "Unlucky"...</i>

00:18:56.050 --> 00:18:57.630
The ceiling tiles just fell off!

00:18:57.720 --> 00:18:58.720
Are you alright, Hii?

00:18:58.800 --> 00:19:00.550
<i>...because she still remains unlucky.</i>

00:19:00.640 --> 00:19:01.930
Hey! You okay?

00:19:02.010 --> 00:19:04.260
<i>Unlike she does, Satou's normal doesn't</i>
<i>affect other people.</i>

00:19:04.350 --> 00:19:05.930
<i>So, is this a draw after all?</i>

00:19:06.020 --> 00:19:09.350
-Are you alright?
-Yeah... I'm... fine.

00:19:09.440 --> 00:19:11.190
You don't look fine!
Let's go see the school nurse!

00:19:11.270 --> 00:19:12.900
Hii, watch out!

00:19:12.980 --> 00:19:14.360
CRASH!

00:19:15.070 --> 00:19:16.190
Hii is trapped!

00:19:16.280 --> 00:19:18.070
Kusuo! Why didn't you stop it?

00:19:18.150 --> 00:19:20.950
<i>I was going to, but someone cut in</i>
<i>before I did.</i>

00:19:21.490 --> 00:19:23.570
-Are you alright, Hii?
-Suzumiya!

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:26.330
Phew, she seems to be alright.

00:19:26.410 --> 00:19:27.950
<i>I hope he is alright.</i>

00:19:28.040 --> 00:19:29.660
I'm okay, but...

00:19:29.750 --> 00:19:31.790
Satou tried to protect me and...

00:19:31.870 --> 00:19:33.250
-Satou?
-Are you alright, Satou?

00:19:33.330 --> 00:19:35.540
-For real? Why is he there?
<i>-Yeah, I'm surprised, too.</i>

00:19:35.630 --> 00:19:37.590
<i>But it wasn't actually impossible.</i>

00:19:38.130 --> 00:19:39.550
<i>He is average about everything.</i>

00:19:39.630 --> 00:19:42.510
<i>Actually, nothing was out of ordinary</i>
<i>as an average guy's action.</i>

00:19:42.590 --> 00:19:44.760
<i>In short, Satou has feelings</i>
<i>for Hii Suzumiya.</i>

00:19:44.850 --> 00:19:45.930
DO YOU WANT TO SAVE A GIRL YOU LOVE?

00:19:46.010 --> 00:19:46.970
<i>This could be...</i>

00:19:47.060 --> 00:19:49.390
<i>-Oh... I'm so unlucky...</i>
-Satou!

00:19:49.480 --> 00:19:52.230
<i>So, Suzumiya was safe. I'm relieved.</i>

00:19:52.310 --> 00:19:53.230
Are you alright?

00:19:53.310 --> 00:19:55.480
<i>Wait... Could I be...</i>

00:19:55.560 --> 00:19:56.820
Hang in there, Satou!

00:19:56.900 --> 00:19:58.030
<i>I'm lying on her lap!</i>

00:19:58.110 --> 00:20:01.490
<i>His luck meter is back to 50! His "Normal"</i>
<i>completely defeated her "Unlucky"!</i>

00:20:01.990 --> 00:20:04.820
<i>Satou's normalness doesn't affect</i>
<i>other people,</i>

00:20:04.910 --> 00:20:08.740
<i>but when he gets involved with bad luck,</i>
<i>though his luck temporarily drops,</i>

00:20:08.830 --> 00:20:11.120
<i>-it won't make anyone unhappy.</i>
-You mean...

00:20:11.210 --> 00:20:14.790
<i>-Yes, I mean, he can void her bad luck.</i>
-Nice!

00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:17.800
<i>But this works only as long as</i>
<i>Hii is with Satou.</i>

00:20:17.880 --> 00:20:19.050
<i>There's a big obstacle.</i>

00:20:19.590 --> 00:20:20.550
THE BIGGEST MISFORTUNE

00:20:20.630 --> 00:20:23.720
<i>That is, Hii Suzumiya is into Toritsuka.</i>

00:20:23.800 --> 00:20:26.300
<i>Anyway, let's work on a secret plan</i>
<i>to make Toritsuka act awful</i>

00:20:26.390 --> 00:20:28.260
<i>to be hated by her, so that</i>
<i>Satou and Hii can get together.</i>

00:20:28.350 --> 00:20:30.680
-Umm... Is he gonna cooperate with us?
<i>-Why not?</i>

00:20:30.770 --> 00:20:32.440
<i>He told me to do something to save her.</i>

00:20:32.520 --> 00:20:36.150
Because he knows Hii likes him,
so he can go out with her if you save her.

00:20:36.230 --> 00:20:37.520
If she hates him, it's a different story.

00:20:37.610 --> 00:20:38.980
<i>Yeah, right.</i>

00:20:39.070 --> 00:20:40.360
<i>He is a jerk.</i>

00:22:09.030 --> 00:22:11.030
Subtitle translation by Kanako Murakoshi
